type: software
title: >-
  Environmental Impact of Medical Record-based Provider-to-provider
  Telemedicine in the Catalan Health System
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline estimating travel-related greenhouse gas emissions
  potentially avoided by asynchronous provider-to-provider interconsultations
  (e-consults) in the Catalan public health system.
